OL,3,CTuchel praises Alex Scott's 'spirit'
OL,4,Cdespite World Cup omission
OL,6,FGuernsey footballer Alex Scott has
OL,7,Ffailed to make it into Thomas Tuchel's
OL,8,F26-man England squad for the World Cup.
OL,10,FThe Bournemouth player was named in
OL,11,Fthe German's 55-man provisional group
OL,12,Flast week and it's been reported that
OL,13,Fhe will still travel to the United
OL,14,FStates as part of the Three Lions'
OL,15,Fpreparation for the tournament.
OL,17,FScott, 22, is yet to make an
OL,18,Fappearance for England at senior level
OL,19,Fbut was in the squad for the team's
OL,20,Ffinal World Cup qualifiers against
OL,21,FAlbania and Serbia in November.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G1/7
