PN,35703
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F357A1783972084
OL,3,CTuchel praises Alex Scott's 'spirit'
OL,4,Cdespite World Cup omission
OL,6,FHe made 15 appearances for Guernsey FC
OL,7,Fin 2019-2020 before a three-year spell
OL,8,Fat Bristol City and a transfer to
OL,9,FBournemouth in 2023, and has since
OL,10,Fplayed 86 times for the club.
OL,12,FSpeaking about his omission from the
OL,13,FWorld Cup squad, Scott said: "I'm
OL,14,Fgutted not to be part of the squad.
OL,15,FI'm not too upset because I feel like
OL,16,FI've done everything I could have done
OL,17,Fto be in there.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G3/7
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'R(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext PageBCh Is Sport CReg RadioFRewind
FL,358,380,250,120,000,100
PN,35704
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F357A1783972084
OL,3,CTuchel praises Alex Scott's 'spirit'
OL,4,Cdespite World Cup omission
OL,6,F"But it's obviously nice that they
OL,7,Freally want me to go there and be a
OL,8,Fpart of the prep camp as well and help
OL,9,Fthe team prepare for the World Cup.
OL,11,F"So that was never an opportunity that
OL,12,FI was going to say no to.
OL,14,F"It's going to be great to be around
OL,15,Fthe group again and help prepare for
OL,16,Fthe fixtures in Miami in the heat.
OL,18,F"I can't wait for it. it's going to be
OL,19,Famazing. And yeah, fingers crossed I
OL,20,Fcan hopefully make my debut out there."
OL,26,@sD@AOU
