PN,35705
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F357A1783972084
OL,3,CTuchel praises Alex Scott's 'spirit'
OL,4,Cdespite World Cup omission
OL,6,FEngland manager Tuchel, who was a
OL,7,FChampions League winner with Chelsea
OL,8,Fin 2021, expressed his delight at
OL,9,FScott taking up the opportunity to
OL,10,Ftrain with the team.
OL,12,FHe said: "I'm really happy these guys
OL,13,Fare with us, especially Alex, who was
OL,14,Fwith us in the list of 55 and had a
OL,15,Fkind of disappointing phone call as
OL,16,Fwell, that he didn't make the first
OL,17,Fcut but the reaction of him was
OL,18,Foutstanding, the commitment, the wish
OL,19,Fto be in pre-camp and to just be a
OL,20,Fstep closer to the team was not even a
OL,21,Fquestion for him.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G5/7
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'R(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
