FL,358,380,250,120,000,100
PN,35706
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F357A1783972084
OL,3,CTuchel praises Alex Scott's 'spirit'
OL,4,Cdespite World Cup omission
OL,6,F"He showed me his character and his
OL,7,Fspirit so I'm delighted that he's with
OL,8,Fus because it was a close call and he
OL,9,Fgets a chance to take a step closer
OL,10,Fand get a cap."
OL,12,FThe World Cup kicks off on 11 June
OL,13,Fwith the Three Lions opening their
OL,14,Fcampaign against Croatia six days
OL,15,Flater.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G6/7
